    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Conditional endings",
     "texto": [
      "The endings for all the conjugations are: **-ei, -esti, -ebbe, -emmo, -este, -ebbero**.",
      "Remember that in **-are** verbs the thematic vowel changes to **-e-**: **parlare → parler-ei**, **passare → passer-ei**. In **-ere** and **-ire** verbs their vowel is kept: **prendere → prender-ei**, **vivere → viver-ei**, **partire → partir-ei**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
